<title>UK: Pearson seeking to sell SES stake.</title>
<headline>Pearson seeking to sell SES stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearson Plc chief executive Marjorie Scardino said on Monday that the company was likely to dispose of its six percent stake in Societe Europeenne des Satellites, the Luxembourg-based satellite company.</p>
<p>Scardino said that Pearson &quot;was looking at exit strategies&quot; for the SES stake.</p>
</text>
